Root cause:
The bug was caused by having two nodes in the Device Tree Source (DTS) file with the same name "regulator1", which led to one regulator definition overwriting the other. This conflict occurred between a 3.3V regulator for the eMMC and LVDS decoder and a 12V regulator for the backlight. The solution involved renaming the regulators with unique identifiers to prevent such conflicts.
